1
00:00:12,220 --> 00:00:14,305
What's with him?

2
00:00:16,474 --> 00:00:18,184
Whatever.

3
00:00:18,184 --> 00:00:19,296
Better off alone anyway.

4
00:00:29,237 --> 00:00:30,025
I came by to see

5
