7
00:00:33,992 --> 00:00:35,118
Good.

8
00:00:35,869 --> 00:00:37,495
Don't mind me. Go ahead.

9
00:00:43,084 --> 00:00:44,461
Seonghun's parents are

10
00:00:45,420 --> 00:00:47,839
